================================================================================
2. Upstream terms, for files derived from chordee/kimodo-houdini-bridge
================================================================================

    .gitattributes
    .gitignore
    README.md
    docker-compose.bridge.yaml
    docs/kimodo-tpose-parsing.md          (unchanged from upstream)
